import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Troubleshooting" description="Diagnose CopyPatch v2 embedded-route, storage, authentication, and conflict issues.">
  <h1>Troubleshooting</h1>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Symptom</th><th>Check</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Editor never opens</td><td>Confirm <code>CopyPatchProvider</code> wraps the page and the URL includes <code>?copypatch=1</code>.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Route returns 404</td><td>Mount the host route at <code>/__copypatch/api/v2</code>; do not use the v1 path.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>ORIGIN_REJECTED</code></td><td>Call the embedded route from the host's exact origin. Remove separate-server, proxy, and CORS settings.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>CSRF_FAILED</code></td><td>For built-in auth, start a fresh same-origin session. For host auth, check the adapter's mutation verification.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>REVISION_CONFLICT</code></td><td>Refresh the editor snapshot and reapply the intended changes.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Storage errors</td><td>Run migrations, verify SQLite file and directory access, or verify the PostgreSQL connection and schema permissions.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Static deployment</td><td>Use a server-capable host. Static-only output cannot provide editing, storage, or authentication.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</DocsLayout>
